        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 99NWHA-48, 2-3/4\" x 48\" Door Shoe</b>\r\n<p>\r\nExtra tall heavy duty door shoe use to close the bottom gap on a under cut door. Also use to cover a rusted or damaged door bottom. These 48 inch long door shoes are made from non rusting T5 aluminum alloy and used on 1-3/4\" thick doors. It includes (2) Gray Nylon Brush sweeps and Black Neoprene Seal that are removable. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAnodized Aluminum finish.  Packaged with #6 x 3/4\" stainless steel sheet metal screws. Very good abrasion resistance, tensile strength and memory. Flame and moisture resistant with a temperature range -20 F to 200 F. BHMA Certified to ANSI/BHMA A156.22 performance tests for heat, cold, air infiltration and smoke infiltration. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/2-3-4-x-36-door-shoe-ngp-99nwha-36\"><b>3 Foot Heavy Duty Door Shoe</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP 99NWHA-48  Door Shoe\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bottom Seal Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Material: T5 aluminum alloy</li>\r\n<li>Nylon Brushes: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Neoprene Seal: Black</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Anodized Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Installation Screws: #6 x 3/4\" Stainless Steel SMS</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
